    "body": "i just tried some reordering of bashrc and made it go away\r\n\r\nthis order of commands works properly:\r\n```\r\nexport PATH=\"$HOME/.cargo/bin:$PATH\"\r\neval \"$(starship init bash)\"\r\n_byobu_sourced=1 . /usr/bin/byobu-launch 2>/dev/null || true\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nthis order of commands results in idle being included:\r\n```\r\nexport PATH=\"$HOME/.cargo/bin:$PATH\"\r\n_byobu_sourced=1 . /usr/bin/byobu-launch 2>/dev/null || true\r\neval \"$(starship init bash)\"\r\n```",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
