    "updated_at": "2020-06-10T02:08:21Z",
    "body": "I tested this on two of the platforms for which this bug was reported (Fedora Silverblue 31 & Manjaro Linux) and found that, while early versions showed this behaviour, it appears to have been unintentionally fixed by the release of v0.32.1, most likely due to the overhaul of the cmd_duration module that was merged in that release.\r\n\r\nI'm going to close this bug for now. If you still have this problem, feel free to open a new issue!",
